
# Mini-LLM-Explorer

## Overview
A beginner-friendly Large Language Model (LLM)
text generation project built using Python and
Hugging Face Transformers.

## Model
DistilGPT2

## Technologies
- Python
- PyTorch
- Hugging Face Transformers

## Features
- Pretrained language model loading
- Prompt-based text generation
- Adjustable generation parameters
- Interactive command-line interface

## Learning Objectives
- Understand pretrained language models
- Explore text generation
- Learn basic LLM inference
- Understand model parameters

## Future Improvements
- Experiment with larger language models
- Explore AMD ROCm GPU acceleration
- Compare CPU and GPU inference performance

## Disclaimer
This project uses a small pretrained text-generation
model for educational experimentation. Its output
may be inaccurate or repetitive.
